title: $:/themes/tiddlywiki/workbench/sticky
tags: [[$:/tags/Stylesheet]]
code-body: yes

<!-- When sticky titles are enabled, vanilla gives the title an opaque
     background (tiddler-background). Override it to match THIS theme's sheet
     so the stuck header stays consistent. Higher specificity than vanilla's
     rule; only emitted while sticky is on.

     The title already carries its own bottom hairline from story.tid, which is
     what keeps body text from scrolling invisibly under the stuck header. -->
<$reveal state="$:/themes/tiddlywiki/vanilla/options/stickytitles" type="match" text="yes">
``
.tc-story-river .tc-tiddler-title {
	background: var(--w-panel);
}
``
</$reveal>
